{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2023_q001", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2023", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2023, "question_number": 1, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 5, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["斜渐近线", "极限"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2023_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2023_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q001.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png", "images/answer_pages/page-3.png"], "answer": "B", "explanation": "当 $x\\to\\infty$ 时，$\\ln\\left(e+\\dfrac{1}{x-1}\\right)=1+\\dfrac{1}{e(x-1)}+o\\left(\\dfrac1x\\right)$，故\n$$\ny=x+\\frac{x}{e(x-1)}+o(1)=x+\\frac1e+o(1).\n$$\n所以斜渐近线为 $y=x+\\dfrac1e$。", "methods": ["泰勒展开"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2023_q002", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2023", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2023, "question_number": 2, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 5, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["分段函数原函数", "连续性"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2023_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2023_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q002.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png", "images/answer_pages/page-3.png"], "answer": "D", "explanation": "左段原函数可取 $\\ln(\\sqrt{1+x^2}+x)+C$，右段原函数可取 $(x+1)\\sin x+\\cos x$。又 $F(0^+)=1$，故左段常数应取 $1$，于是选 $D$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2023_q003", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2023", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2023, "question_number": 3, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 5, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["递推数列", "无穷小比较", "等价无穷小"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2023_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2023_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q003.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png", "images/answer_pages/page-3.png"], "answer": "B", "explanation": "由 $0<\\sin t<t\\ (t>0)$ 知 $x_n\\downarrow0$，且 $x_n-\\sin x_n\\sim \\dfrac{x_n^3}{6}$，所以 $x_n$ 只按幂次速度趋于零。另一方面\n$$\ny_n=\\left(\\frac12\\right)^{2^{n-1}},\n$$\n按双指数速度趋于零，因此 $\\dfrac{y_n}{x_n}\\to0$，故选 $B$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2023_q004", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2023", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2023, "question_number": 4, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 5, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["常系数微分方程", "特征根"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2023_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2023_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q004.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png", "images/answer_pages/page-3.png"], "answer": "C", "explanation": "全部解在整个实轴上有界时，特征根只能是共轭纯虚根 $\\pm i\\omega\\ (\\omega\\ne0)$，故 $a=0$，$b=\\omega^2>0$，所以选 $C$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2023_q005", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2023", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2023, "question_number": 5, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 5, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["参数方程", "可导性"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2023_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2023_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q005.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png", "images/answer_pages/page-3.png"], "answer": "C", "explanation": "当 $t<0$ 时 $f(x)=-x\\sin x$；当 $t\\ge0$ 时 $f(x)=\\dfrac{x}{3}\\sin\\dfrac{x}{3}$。由此可算得 $f'(0^-)=f'(0^+)=0$，故 $f'$ 在 $0$ 处连续；但 $f''(0^-)=2$，$f''(0^+)=\\dfrac23$，故 $f''(0)$ 不存在，选 $C$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2023_q006", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2023", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2023, "question_number": 6, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 5, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["广义积分", "参数最值"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2023_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2023_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q006.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png", "images/answer_pages/page-3.png"], "answer": "A", "explanation": "令 $u=\\ln x$，则\n$$\nf(\\alpha)=\\int_{\\ln2}^{+\\infty}u^{-\\alpha-1}\\,du=\\frac{(\\ln2)^{-\\alpha}}{\\alpha}\\quad(\\alpha>0).\n$$\n对 $\\ln f(\\alpha)$ 求导得极值条件 $-\\ln(\\ln2)-\\dfrac1\\alpha=0$，故\n$$\n\\alpha_0=-\\frac1{\\ln(\\ln2)}.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2023_q007", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2023", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2023, "question_number": 7, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 5, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["导数应用", "极值点", "拐点"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2023_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2023_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q007.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png", "images/answer_pages/page-3.png"], "answer": "C", "explanation": "由\n$$\nf'(x)=e^x(x^2+2x+a)=e^x[(x+1)^2+a-1]\n$$\n知无极值点需 $a\\ge1$；又\n$$\nf''(x)=e^x(x^2+4x+a+2)=e^x[(x+2)^2+a-2]\n$$\n有拐点需 $a<2$。综上 $1\\le a<2$，选 $C$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2023_q008", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2023", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2023, "question_number": 8, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 5, "module": "线性代数", "topics": ["伴随矩阵", "分块矩阵"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2023_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2023_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q008.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png", "images/answer_pages/page-3.png"], "answer": "D", "explanation": "设 $M=\\begin{pmatrix}A&E\\\\O&B\\end{pmatrix}$，则\n$$\nM^{-1}=\\begin{pmatrix}A^{-1}&-A^{-1}B^{-1}\\\\O&B^{-1}\\end{pmatrix}.\n$$\n由 $M^*=|M|M^{-1}=|A||B|M^{-1}$ 得\n$$\nM^*=\\begin{pmatrix}|B|A^*&-A^*B^*\\\\O&|A|B^*\\end{pmatrix},\n$$\n故选 $D$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2023_q009", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2023", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2023, "question_number": 9, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 5, "module": "线性代数", "topics": ["二次型", "规范形"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2023_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2023_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q009.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png", "images/answer_pages/page-3.png"], "answer": "B", "explanation": "该二次型对应对称矩阵恰有一个正惯性指数和一个负惯性指数，秩为 $2$，故其规范形为 $y_1^2-y_2^2$，选 $B$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2023_q010", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2023", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2023, "question_number": 10, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 5, "module": "线性代数", "topics": ["向量组", "线性表示"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2023_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2023_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q010.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png", "images/answer_pages/page-3.png"], "answer": "D", "explanation": "设 $\\gamma=s\\alpha_1+t\\alpha_2=u\\beta_1+v\\beta_2$，按分量联立可得公共表示空间是一条直线，其方向向量为 $(1,5,8)^T$，故选 $D$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2023_q011", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2023", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2023, "question_number": 11, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 5, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["等价无穷小", "泰勒展开"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2023_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2023_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q011.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png", "images/answer_pages/page-3.png"], "answer": "$-2$", "explanation": "展开得 $f(x)=(a+1)x+\\left(b-\\dfrac12\\right)x^2+o(x^2)$，$g(x)=\\dfrac32x^2+o(x^2)$。故 $a=-1$，$b=2$，于是 $ab=-2$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2023_q012", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2023", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2023, "question_number": 12, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 5, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["弧长", "变上限积分"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2023_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2023_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q012.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png", "images/answer_pages/page-3.png"], "answer": "$\\sqrt{3}+\\dfrac{4\\pi}{3}$", "explanation": "由 $y'=\\sqrt{3-x^2}$，弧长为\n$$\nL=\\int_{-\\sqrt3}^{\\sqrt3}\\sqrt{1+y'^2}\\,dx=\\int_{-\\sqrt3}^{\\sqrt3}\\sqrt{4-x^2}\\,dx=\\sqrt3+\\frac{4\\pi}{3}.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2023_q013", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2023", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2023, "question_number": 13, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 5, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["隐函数", "二阶偏导"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2023_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2023_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q013.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png", "images/answer_pages/page-3.png"], "answer": "$-\\dfrac{3}{2}$", "explanation": "由 $(1,1)$ 代入得对应 $z=0$。设 $F=e^z+xz-2x+y$，先求 $z_x=\\dfrac{2-z}{e^z+x}$，在 $(1,1,0)$ 处有 $z_x=1$。再对方程两次求偏导可得 $(e^z+x)z_{xx}+(e^z z_x+1)z_x+z_x=0$，代入得 $2z_{xx}+3=0$，故 $z_{xx}=-\\dfrac32$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2023_q014", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2023", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2023, "question_number": 14, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 5, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["法线"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2023_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2023_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q014.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png", "images/answer_pages/page-3.png"], "answer": "$-\\dfrac{11}{9}$", "explanation": "当 $x=1$ 时解得 $y=1$。对方程求导得 $9x^2=(5y^4+6y^2)y'$，故在 $(1,1)$ 处 $y'=\\dfrac9{11}$。法线斜率为其负倒数，故为 $-\\dfrac{11}{9}$。", "methods": ["隐函数求导"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2023_q015", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2023", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2023, "question_number": 15, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 5, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["积分性质", "函数方程"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2023_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2023_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q015.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png", "images/answer_pages/page-3.png"], "answer": "$\\dfrac{1}{2}$", "explanation": "利用 $f(x+2)=f(x)+x$ 作平移，可得\n$$\n\\int_1^3f(x)dx=\\int_{-1}^1f(u)du.\n$$\n再由 $\\int_0^2f(x)dx=0$ 消去中间项，最终得到 $\\int_1^3f(x)dx=\\dfrac12$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2023_q016", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2023", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2023, "question_number": 16, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 5, "module": "线性代数", "topics": ["线性方程组", "行列式"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2023_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2023_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q016.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png", "images/answer_pages/page-3.png"], "answer": "$8$", "explanation": "先由 $a^3-3a+2=4$ 得 $(a-2)(a+1)^2=0$，故 $a=2$ 或 $a=-1$。再用方程组可解条件分别求得 $b=-4$ 或 $b=\\dfrac72$。代入\n$$\na^3-ab-2a+b\n$$\n两种情形都得 $8$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2023_q017", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2023", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2023, "question_number": 17, "question_type": "solution", "score": 10, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["微分方程", "切线", "最值"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2023_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2023_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q017.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png", "images/answer_pages/page-4.png"], "answer": "(1) $y(x)=x(2-\\ln x)$；\n\n(2) 当点为 $\\left(e^{3/2},\\dfrac12e^{3/2}\\right)$ 时面积最小，最小面积为 $e^3$。", "explanation": "设切线斜率为 $y'$，则切线在 $y$ 轴上的截距为 $y-xy'$。由题意有 $y-xy'=x$，即\n$$\ny'-\\frac{1}{x}y=-1.\n$$\n解得 $y=x(C-\\ln x)$。再由 $(e^2,0)$ 得 $C=2$，故 $y=x(2-\\ln x)$。又切线与坐标轴围成三角形面积\n$$\nS=\\frac{x^2}{2(\\ln x-1)}\n$$\n在 $x>e$ 上取极小。令 $t=\\ln x$，解得最优点 $t=\\dfrac32$，于是\n$$\n\\left(x,y\\right)=\\left(e^{3/2},\\frac12e^{3/2}\\right),\\qquad S_{\\min}=e^3.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2023_q018", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2023", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2023, "question_number": 18, "question_type": "solution", "score": 12, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["多元函数极值", "Hessian"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2023_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2023_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q018.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-3.png", "images/answer_pages/page-4.png"], "answer": "极小值为 $f(-e,k\\pi)=-\\dfrac{e^2}{2}$，其中 $k$ 为偶整数；无极大值。", "explanation": "由 $f_x=e^{\\cos y}+x$、$f_y=-xe^{\\cos y}\\sin y$，驻点满足 $x=-e^{\\cos y}$ 且 $\\sin y=0$，即 $y=k\\pi$。当 $k$ 为偶数时驻点为 $(-e,2m\\pi)$，此时 Hessian 判别为极小点，极小值为 $-\\dfrac{e^2}{2}$；当 $k$ 为奇数时为鞍点，所以无极大值。", "methods": ["Hessian判别"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2023_q019", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2023", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2023, "question_number": 19, "question_type": "solution", "score": 12, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["定积分", "旋转体体积"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2023_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2023_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q019.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-3.png", "images/answer_pages/page-4.png"], "answer": "(1) 面积为 $\\ln(\\sqrt2+1)$；\n\n(2) 旋转体体积为 $\\pi\\left(1-\\dfrac{\\pi}{4}\\right)$。", "explanation": "(1) 面积为\n$$\n\\int_1^{+\\infty}\\frac{1}{x\\sqrt{1+x^2}}dx.\n$$\n作 $x=\\tan\\theta$ 可得结果 $\\ln(\\sqrt2+1)$。\n\n(2) 体积为\n$$\n\\pi\\int_1^{+\\infty}\\frac{1}{x^2(1+x^2)}dx\n=\\pi\\int_1^{+\\infty}\\left(\\frac1{x^2}-\\frac1{1+x^2}\\right)dx,\n$$\n故结果为 $\\pi\\left(1-\\dfrac\\pi4\\right)$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2023_q020", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2023", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2023, "question_number": 20, "question_type": "solution", "score": 12, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["二重积分", "换元"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2023_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2023_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q020.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-3.png", "images/answer_pages/page-4.png"], "answer": "$\\dfrac{\\pi\\ln 2}{8\\sqrt3}$", "explanation": "令 $t=\\dfrac{y}{x}$，则 $y=tx$，且 $0\\le t\\le\\sqrt3$。区域条件化为\n$$\n1\\le x^2(1+t^2-t)\\le2,\n$$\n故对固定 $t$，\n$$\n\\sqrt{\\frac1{1+t^2-t}}\\le x\\le \\sqrt{\\frac2{1+t^2-t}}.\n$$\n又 Jacobian 为 $x$，所以\n$$\nI=\\int_0^{\\sqrt3}\\int_{\\sqrt{1/(1+t^2-t)}}^{\\sqrt{2/(1+t^2-t)}}\\frac{1}{x(3+t^2)}dxdt\n=\\frac{\\ln2}{2}\\int_0^{\\sqrt3}\\frac{dt}{3+t^2}\n=\\frac{\\pi\\ln2}{8\\sqrt3}.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2023_q021", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2023", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2023, "question_number": 21, "question_type": "proof", "score": 12, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["泰勒展开", "介值定理", "极值点"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2023_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2023_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q021.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-3.png", "images/answer_pages/page-4.png"], "answer": "结论成立。", "explanation": "(1) 在 $0$ 处对 $f(a),f(-a)$ 作 Taylor 展开：\n$$\nf(a)=f(0)+af'(0)+\\frac{a^2}{2}f''(\\xi_1),\\qquad\nf(-a)=f(0)-af'(0)+\\frac{a^2}{2}f''(\\xi_2).\n$$\n由 $f(0)=0$ 相加得\n$$\n\\frac{f(a)+f(-a)}{a^2}=\\frac{f''(\\xi_1)+f''(\\xi_2)}{2}.\n$$\n因 $f''$ 连续，故由介值定理存在 $\\xi\\in(-a,a)$ 使上式右端等于 $f''(\\xi)$。\n\n(2) 设 $x_0\\in(-a,a)$ 为极值点，则 $f'(x_0)=0$。在 $x_0$ 处分别展开 $f(a),f(-a)$，相减得\n$$\nf(a)-f(-a)=\\frac{(a-x_0)^2}{2}f''(\\eta_1)-\\frac{(a+x_0)^2}{2}f''(\\eta_2).\n$$\n令 $M=\\max_{[-a,a]}|f''(x)|$，则\n$$\n|f(a)-f(-a)|\\le\\frac{(a-x_0)^2+(a+x_0)^2}{2}M\\le2a^2M.\n$$\n所以\n$$\nM\\ge\\frac{1}{2a^2}|f(a)-f(-a)|.\n$$\n由连续性，存在 $\\eta\\in(-a,a)$ 使 $|f''(\\eta)|=M$，结论成立。", "methods": ["泰勒展开"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2023_q022", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2023", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2023, "question_number": 22, "question_type": "solution", "score": 12, "module": "线性代数", "topics": ["线性变换矩阵", "相似对角化"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2023_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2023_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q022.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-3.png", "images/answer_pages/page-4.png"], "answer": "(1) $A=\\begin{pmatrix}1&1&1\\\\2&-1&1\\\\0&1&-1\\end{pmatrix}$；\n\n(2) 可取\n$$\nP=\\begin{pmatrix}4&0&-1\\\\3&-1&0\\\\1&1&2\\end{pmatrix},\\qquad\n\\Lambda=\\operatorname{diag}(2,-2,-1).\n$$", "explanation": "由线性变换对标准基的作用直接得到\n$$\nA=\\begin{pmatrix}1&1&1\\\\2&-1&1\\\\0&1&-1\\end{pmatrix}.\n$$\n再算得特征多项式为 $(\\lambda-2)(\\lambda+2)(\\lambda+1)$，对应可取特征向量 $(4,3,1)^T,(0,-1,1)^T,(-1,0,2)^T$。以它们为列组成\n$$\nP=\\begin{pmatrix}4&0&-1\\\\3&-1&0\\\\1&1&2\\end{pmatrix},\n$$\n则 $P^{-1}AP=\\operatorname{diag}(2,-2,-1)$。", "methods": []}
